(   * Los Angeles Smog: Chemically OXIDIZING smog dominated by secondary oxidants \(ground-level) Tj
T*
(   ozone O3, NO2, Peroxyacetyl nitrate PAN, aldehydes\).) Tj
T*
(   - Parameter: Primary Anthropogenic Source) Tj
T*
(   * London Smog: Domestic open-hearth burning of bituminous coal and industrial coal-fired power) Tj
T*
(   stations.) Tj
T*
(   * Los Angeles Smog: Exhaust emissions from internal combustion engine vehicles \(gasoline/diesel) Tj
T*
(   traffic\) and industrial solvents.) Tj
T*
(   - Parameter: Meteorological Pre-conditions) Tj
T*
(   * London Smog: Cold winter temperatures \(0 to 5 deg C\), stagnant radiation temperature) Tj
T*
(   inversions, high relative humidity, and dense fog.) Tj
T*
(   * Los Angeles Smog: Warm summer/autumn temperatures \(> 25 to 35 deg C\), intense ultraviolet) Tj
T*
(   \(UV\) solar radiation, low humidity, and subsidence inversions.) Tj
T*
(   - Parameter: Peak Time of Diurnal Occurrence) Tj
T*
(   * London Smog: Early morning before sunrise \(winter fog trapped near ground\).) Tj
T*
(   * Los Angeles Smog: Midday to early afternoon \(12:00 to 15:00 hours\) when cumulative solar UV) Tj
T*
(   flux reaches its daily peak.) Tj
T*
(   - Parameter: Human Pathology) Tj
T*
(   * London Smog: Acute bronchial spasms, acute pulmonary edema, fatal chronic bronchitis in) Tj
T*
(   elderly individuals.) Tj
T*
(   * Los Angeles Smog: Intense eye irritation \(lachrymatory action of PAN\), respiratory tightness,) Tj
T*
(   impaired athletic lung capacity, foliar necrosis in crops.) Tj
T*
