T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Microbial Ecology and Engineering Design of the Activated Sludge Process \(ASP\):) Tj
T*
(   1. Process Architecture:) Tj
T*
(   The Activated Sludge Process is an engineered suspended-growth biological wastewater treatment) Tj
T*
(   system comprising:) Tj
T*
(   - Aeration Basin: High-rate biological reactor where wastewater is mixed with a concentrated) Tj
T*
(   microbial culture \(Mixed Liquor Suspended Solids, MLSS\) and aerated continuously.) Tj
T*
(   - Secondary Clarifier: Gravity settling basin separating purified water from microbial biomass.) Tj
T*
(   - Return Activated Sludge \(RAS\) Line: Recycles settled biomass back to the aeration basin to) Tj
T*
