T*
(   terminal respiratory electron acceptor:) Tj
T*
(   Fe\(III\)OOH \(s\) + Organic Carbon -> Fe2+ \(aq\) + HCO3-) Tj
T*
(   Reductive dissolution of the iron oxyhydroxide host mineral collapses the sorption matrix,) Tj
