(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze the physical thermodynamics of Thermal Pollution from thermoelectric facilities, Henry's Law gas solubility decline, and cooling tower engineering.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Thermal Pollution: Condenser Thermodynamics, Henry's Law Solubility, and Cooling Towers:) Tj
T*
(   1. Origin of Thermal Waste Heat \(Carnot Limit\):) Tj
T*
(   Thermoelectric power stations \(coal, natural gas, nuclear\) convert thermal energy into) Tj
T*
(   electrical power via Rankine steam cycles:) Tj
T*
(   - Thermal Efficiency: eta_th = W_net / Q_in = 1 - \(T_cold / T_hot\) approx 33% to 40%.) Tj
T*
(   - Over 60% to 67% of total thermal energy generated must be rejected as waste heat to condenser) Tj
T*
(   cooling water. In once-through cooling systems, cooling water flow is discharged directly back) Tj
T*
(   into natural rivers or lakes at temperatures 8 to 15 deg C above ambient.) Tj
T*
(   2. Thermodynamic Solubility Collapse \(Henry's Law\):) Tj
T*
(   - Henry's Law states that the equilibrium concentration of dissolved gas \(C_aq\) is directly) Tj
T*
(   proportional to its partial pressure \(P_gas\):) Tj
T*
(   C_aq = k_H\(T\) * P_gas) Tj
T*
(   - The Henry's Law volatility constant increases with temperature according to the van 't Hoff) Tj
T*
(   equation, meaning gas dissolution in water is an EXOTHERMIC process:) Tj
T*
(   O2 \(g\) <-> O2 \(aq\) + Delta H_solution \(negative\).) Tj
T*
(   - By Le Chatelier's Principle, elevating water temperature drives dissolved oxygen out of) Tj
T*
(   solution into the gas phase! Saturated Dissolved Oxygen \(DO\) plummets:) Tj
T*
(   * At 0 deg C: Saturated DO = 14.6 mg/L.) Tj
T*
(   * At 20 deg C: Saturated DO = 9.1 mg/L.) Tj
T*
(   * At 35 deg C: Saturated DO drops to 7.0 mg/L.) Tj
T*
(   3. Ecological Synergistic Stress:) Tj
T*
(   - Van 't Hoff's Q10 Rule: An organism's basal metabolic rate doubles for every 10 deg C) Tj
T*
(   increase in temperature \(Q10 ~ 2.0\).) Tj
T*
(   - As water warms, aquatic poikilothermic organisms \(fishes, invertebrates\) experience) Tj
T*
(   accelerated metabolic oxygen demand precisely when the physical oxygen availability in the) Tj
T*
(   water has collapsed!) Tj
T*
(   4. Wet Evaporative Cooling Tower Mechanics:) Tj
T*
(   - Counter-current hyperbolic cooling towers spray heated condenser water downward through PVC) Tj
T*
(   packing lattices while atmospheric air drafts upward.) Tj
T*
(   - Approximately 1% to 2% of circulating water evaporates into the air. The high latent heat of) Tj
T*
(   vaporization of water \(Delta H_vap = 2,440 kJ/kg\) cools the remaining 98% of circulating water) Tj
T*
(   down toward the ambient wet-bulb temperature, enabling closed-loop water recirculation.) Tj
T*
