T*
(   - Employs extreme acidophilic chemolithoautotrophic bacteria \(Acidithiobacillus ferrooxidans) Tj
T*
(   and Acidithiobacillus thiooxidans\):) Tj
T*
(   Microbes oxidize ferrous iron \(Fe2+\) and elemental sulfur, generating ferric sulfate) Tj
