(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the Extended Producer Responsibility \(EPR\) policy architecture for E-Waste and Plastic Waste, including digital EPR certificate trading.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Extended Producer Responsibility \(EPR\): Policy Architecture, Targets, and Market Certificates:) Tj
T*
(   1. Foundational Economic Principle \(Thomas Lindhqvist, 1990\):) Tj
T*
(   Extended Producer Responsibility is an environmental policy strategy that extends a) Tj
T*
(   manufacturer's physical and financial liability for a product to the post-consumer stage of its) Tj
T*
(   lifecycle. It internalizes environmental disposal costs into the initial product design and) Tj
T*
(   retail price, incentivizing manufacturers to adopt eco-design, modular repairability, and) Tj
T*
(   non-toxic materials.) Tj
T*
(   2. The Indian E-Waste and Plastic Waste Management Framework:) Tj
T*
(   - Mandated Entities: Producers, Importers, and Brand Owners \(PIBOs\).) Tj
T*
(   - Progressive Statutory Targets: PIBOs are legally mandated to collect and environmentally) Tj
T*
(   recycle a progressively increasing percentage of the average weight of products placed on the) Tj
T*
(   market over preceding years \(escalating from 60% up to 80-100%\).) Tj
T*
(   3. The Digital Centralized EPR Portal and Certificate Trading Architecture:) Tj
T*
(   - Registration and Tracking: All PIBOs, collection centers, dismantlers, and registered) Tj
T*
(   recyclers must register on a centralized online digital portal administered by the Central) Tj
T*
(   Pollution Control Board \(CPCB\).) Tj
T*
(   - Generation of EPR Certificates: When an authorized recycler processes and converts e-waste or) Tj
T*
(   plastic waste into certified secondary raw materials, the digital portal automatically issues) Tj
T*
(   verified, tamper-proof EPR Certificates corresponding to the certified tonnage of recycled) Tj
T*
(   materials.) Tj
T*
(   - Market Trading of Certificates:) Tj
T*
(   * Producers can meet their annual statutory EPR obligations by purchasing EPR certificates from) Tj
T*
(   registered recyclers on the digital exchange.) Tj
T*
(   * This market-based mechanism creates strong economic incentives for recyclers, establishes) Tj
T*
(   transparency, eliminates fraudulent paper documentation, and drives private investment into) Tj
T*
(   formal state-of-the-art recycling infrastructure.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
