45 780 Td
(   recycles, and reclaims 100% of industrial wastewater, eliminating all liquid effluent discharge) Tj
T*
(   into environmental streams. All dissolved solids are precipitated out as dry, solid mineral) Tj
T*
(   salts suitable for commercial resale or secure landfilling.) Tj
T*
(   2. The Multi-Stage ZLD Process Train:) Tj
T*
(   - Stage 1: Physicochemical and Biological Pre-treatment:) Tj
T*
(   High-rate Dissolved Air Flotation \(DAF\), Chemical Softening \(Lime-Soda softening to precipitate) Tj
T*
(   Ca2+ and Mg2+ hardness down to < 10 mg/L\), and Membrane Bioreactors \(MBR\) to remove suspended) Tj
T*
(   solids, oil/grease, and organic COD.) Tj
T*
(   - Stage 2: Membrane Concentration \(High-Pressure Reverse Osmosis, HPRO\):) Tj
T*
(   Effluent is concentrated across multiple RO stages \(operating up to 80 to 120 bar hydrostatic) Tj
T*
(   pressure\). Achieves 70% to 85% water recovery as ultra-pure permeate reused in factory boilers,) Tj
T*
(   leaving a concentrated brine containing 50,000 to 100,000 mg/L Total Dissolved Solids \(TDS\).) Tj
T*
(   - Stage 3: Thermal Brine Concentrator with Mechanical Vapor Recompression \(MVR\):) Tj
T*
(   * The RO reject brine enters a falling-film vertical tube evaporator.) Tj
T*
(   * Thermodynamic MVR Principle: Water vapor boiling off the falling film at 100 deg C is) Tj
T*
(   compressed by a high-efficiency centrifugal mechanical compressor. Mechanical compression) Tj
T*
(   elevates vapor pressure and saturation temperature to 105-110 deg C.) Tj
T*
(   * This superheated steam is re-injected into the shell side of the same evaporator tubes,) Tj
T*
(   condensing and transferring its latent heat of condensation to evaporate incoming brine! This) Tj
T*
(   eliminates continuous steam supply, slashing thermal operating energy by 80%. Concentrates) Tj
T*
(   brine up to 250,000 mg/L TDS \(near saturation\).) Tj
T*
(   - Stage 4: Forced-Circulation Crystallizer and Centrifuge:) Tj
T*
(   The saturated brine is pumped through a high-velocity heat exchanger into a crystallizer vessel) Tj
T*
(   where pure mineral crystals \(NaCl, Na2SO4\) nucleate and grow. The salt slurry is dewatered in) Tj
T*
(   solid-bowl centrifuges, yielding dry salt crystals for industrial reuse, closing the liquid) Tj
T*
(   loop completely.) Tj
T*
